  `small` / `smallMiB` count the residue creates that are linear by a stock rule that has
  nothing to do with MUTABLE or with a format list: fd6_layout.c:155-161
    if (!params->force_ubwc && layout->width0 < linear_fallback_threshold_texels) ->
       ubwc = false, tile_mode = TILE6_LINEAR
  with the threshold 16 * blockwidth on a7xx (`FDL_LINEAR_FALLBACK_THRESHOLD` in
  freedreno_layout.h:251, scaled by supports_linear_mipmap_threshold_in_blocks at :254-261,
  which a7xx_base sets True at freedreno_devices.py:785).  Block widths come from vk.xml via
  tests/vk-fmt-classes.json (155 pipe formats, default 1).  Visible in the log by
  one format on both sides of its threshold:
    PIPE_FORMAT_R16G16B16A16_FLOAT 8x8x8 ... tile=linear ... size=32768   (8 < 16)
    PIPE_FORMAT_R16G16B16A16_FLOAT 32x32x16 ... tile=tiled ... size=262144 (32 >= 16)
    PIPE_FORMAT_RGTC1_UNORM 32x32x32 ... tile=linear ... size=131072      (32 < 16*4)
    PIPE_FORMAT_RGTC1_UNORM 256x256x1 ... tile=tiled ... size=32768       (256 >= 16*4)

